피하십시오.","sideEffects":"구역, 구토, 설사, 묽은변, 붉은반점, 부전수축(심장박동정지), 중추신경계 기능저하, 변비, 식욕부진, 홍반(붉은 반점), 두드러기, 습진, 발진, 반구진성 발진, 가려움, 부종(부기), 신부전 또는 심부전 환자에서의 부종이나 수분저류 등이 나타나는 경우 복용을 즉각 중지하고 의사 또는 약사와 상의하십시오.","storage":"습기와 빛을 피해 실온에서 보관하십시오.\n어린이의 손이 닿지 않는 곳에 보관하십시오.","image":"https://nedrug.mfds.go.kr/pbp/cmn/itemImageDownload/1P2JYwFsBRn","openDe":"2025-04-30","updateDe":"2026-10-21","permitDate":"2024-02-27","source":"mfds-drug"},{"id":"202402828","name":"세티서방정50밀리그램(토피라메이트)","company":"(주)휴온스","otc":"전문의약품","cls":"항전간제","ingr":["토피라메이트"],"ingrEn":["Topiramate"],"ingredients":[],"efficacy":"","usage":"","warn":"","caution":"","interaction":"","sideEffects":"","storage":"","image":"https://nedrug.mfds.go.kr/pbp/cmn/itemImageDownload/1PLp5H1IayH","openDe":"","updateDe":"","permitDate":"2024-11-29","source":"mfds-permit"},{"id":"202500782","name":"엠파메트서방정10/1000밀리그램(엠파글리플로진,메트포르민염산염)","company":"대원제약(주)","otc":"전문의약품","cls":"당뇨병용제","ingr":["엠파글리플로진","Metformin Hydrochloride with Colloidal Anhydrous Silica"],"ingrEn":["Empagliflozin","Metformin Hydrochloride with Colloidal Anhydrous Silica"],"ingredients":[],"efficacy":"","usage":"","warn":"","caution":"","interaction":"","sideEffects":"","storage":"","image":"","openDe":"","updateDe":"","permitDate":"2025-04-03","source":"mfds-permit"},{"id":"202502003","name":"엠포진듀오서방정12.5/1000밀리그램(엠파글리플로진,메트포르민)","company":"삼진제약(주)","otc":"전문의약품","cls":"당뇨병용제","ingr":["엠파글리플로진","메트포르민염산염"],"ingrEn":["Empagliflozin","Metformin Hydrochloride"],"ingredients":[],"efficacy":"","usage":"","warn":"","caution":"","interaction":"","sideEffects":"","storage":"","image":"https://nedrug.mfds.go.kr/pbp/cmn/itemImageDownload/1PmqgbkUHd-","openDe":"","updateDe":"","permitDate":"2025-07-31","source":"mfds-permit"}]}
